 * The :root and .dark blocks define the actual color values. Tokens the
 * oc8 Brand Style Sheet (v1.0) defines explicitly are copied verbatim in
 * its own hex/rgba format for 1:1 traceability back to that doc, rather
 * than hand-converted to oklch and risking a silent drift; tokens the
 * sheet doesn't cover keep the pre-existing oklch values.
 *
 * To add a new semantic color:
 * 1. Add the variable to :root (light value) and .dark (dark value) --
 *    hex/rgba if the brand sheet defines it, oklch otherwise
 * 2. Register it in @theme inline as --color-<name>: var(--<name>)
